---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Crumbs from '../components/Crumbs.astro';
import { u } from '../lib/url.js';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Use" description="The terms for using Abhyas: personal practice use, content ownership, accuracy and limits of liability." path="/terms/">
  <Crumbs items={[{ n: 'Home', u: u('/') }, { n: 'Terms of use' }]} />
  <section class="wrap sec"><div class="prose">
<h1>Terms of Use</h1>
<p>Last updated October 2026.</p>
<p>By using Abhyas you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>

<h2>Use of the site</h2>
<p>The site is provided free for personal exam practice. Do not copy, resell or redistribute its content in bulk, do not use automated tools to scrape it, and do not try to disrupt or attack the site.</p>

<h2>Content and ownership</h2>
<p>The design, mock tests, solutions and articles on Abhyas belong to Abhyas or its authors. Previous year papers are public records released by their exam conducting bodies. You may quote a short part of an article with a clear link back to the page. For any other use, ask us first through the <a href={u('/contact/')}>contact page</a>. To report a copyright concern, see the <a href={u('/dmca/')}>copyright page</a>.</p>

<h2>No guarantee</h2>
<p>We work to keep questions and answers correct, using the process in the <a href={u('/editorial-policy/')}>editorial policy</a>, but we do not guarantee that they are error free, complete or up to date. Practice results do not predict your result in any real exam. Always rely on official notifications. See the <a href={u('/disclaimer/')}>disclaimer</a>.</p>

<h2>Advertising and third-party links</h2>
<p>The site may show ads and may link to other websites. We do not control them and are not responsible for them. How ads and cookies work is explained in the <a href={u('/privacy-policy/')}>privacy policy</a>.</p>

<h2>Liability</h2>
<p>Abhyas and its owner are not liable for any loss arising from the use of this site or from reliance on its content, to the extent permitted by law.</p>

<h2>Governing law</h2>
<p>These terms are governed by the laws of India.</p>

<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>We may change these terms or the site at any time. The latest version is always on this page, with its date at the top.</p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
